  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Description\n\nChanged my timezone to GMT-5 because my headset was set to the wrong zone.  Not even a minute after that, the anti-cheat gets me for \"cheating\".\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nJust change your timezone in Meta Quest settings.  I think I did it 2 times, and that's what flagged me.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Once\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p1-1937-299983b13b-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-01_11-42-45.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_910dd997-829a-433a-a473-0163289609a3/1/file)",
